msgstr "الثابت %s معرّف أكثر من مرة في wp-config.php، لذا لا يمكن تغييره إلا من هناك."

#. translators: %s: a wp-config.php constant name, such as WP_DEBUG_LOG.
#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:14278
msgid "%s is set inside a condition in wp-config.php, so it can only be changed there."
msgstr "الثابت %s معيّن داخل شرط في wp-config.php، لذا لا يمكن تغييره إلا من هناك."

#. translators: %s: a wp-config.php constant name, such as WP_DEBUG_LOG.
#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:14282
msgid "%s is set after wp-config.php loads WordPress, so it never takes effect; move it above that line in wp-config.php."
msgstr "الثابت %s معيَّن بعد أن يحمّل wp-config.php ووردبريس، لذا لا يسري مفعوله أبدًا؛ انقله فوق ذلك السطر في wp-config.php."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:14299
msgid "Could not find a safe place to add the constant."
msgstr "تعذّر إيجاد موضع آمن لإضافة الثابت."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:14554
msgid "That constant is not editable."
msgstr "هذا الثابت غير قابل للتحرير."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:14557
msgid "File modifications are disabled on this site."
msgstr "تعديل الملفات معطّل على هذا الموقع."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:14561
msgid "wp-config.php is not writable."
msgstr "wp-config.php غير قابل للكتابة."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:14565
msgid "Could not read wp-config.php."
msgstr "تعذّرت قراءة wp-config.php."

#. translators: %s: a wp-config.php constant name, such as WP_DEBUG_LOG.
#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:14571
msgid "The %s line in wp-config.php is not the one WordPress runs with, so it can only be changed there."
msgstr "سطر %s في wp-config.php ليس السطر الذي يعمل به ووردبريس، لذا لا يمكن تغييره إلا من هناك."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:14583
msgid "The change would break wp-config.php, so it was not saved."
msgstr "كان التغيير سيعطّل wp-config.php، لذا لم يُحفظ."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:14592
msgid "Could not write a rollback copy of wp-config.php, so the change was not made."
msgstr "تعذّرت كتابة نسخة تراجع من wp-config.php، لذا لم يُطبَّق التغيير."

#. translators: %s: the file name of the kept copy of wp-config.php.
#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:14602
msgid "wp-config.php did not save completely and could not be put back. A copy of the original is kept as %s."
msgstr "لم يُحفظ wp-config.php بالكامل وتعذّرت استعادته. احتُفظ بنسخة من الأصل باسم %s."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:14655
msgid "wp-config.php did not save completely, so it was put back as it was. Nothing changed."
msgstr "لم يُحفظ wp-config.php بالكامل، لذا أُعيد كما كان. لم يتغير شيء."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:14657
